---
import SidebarLayout from "../../layouts/SideBarLayout.astro";
---

<SidebarLayout title="Weathered Chaos (2025)">
    <h1>Weathered Chaos (2025)</h1>
    <p>
        Weathered Chaos is a double pendulum system simulation whose behavior is
        influenced by the user's input + real-time weather data. The movement of
        the pendulums generates MIDI data that can be sent to a DAW to generate
        music, it also generates latent vectors to navigate RAVE latent spaces
        that change based on the weather data + the user's input.
    </p>
    <p>
        The idea behind this project was to generate real-time ambient music
        that reflects the current mood based on the weather using chaos theory
        and symbolic and audio data.
    </p>
    <p>
        You can find the code <a
            href="https://github.com/theofuhrmann/weathered-chaos"
            target="_blank">here</a
        >.
    </p>
    <img
        src="/images/Weathered_Chaos_2.png"
        alt="Liquiprism"
        style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; width: 600px; align-self: center;"
    />
</SidebarLayout>
